## About this package

This package is part of the ${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_PATCH} release of Emgu LiteRT. It contains:

- `Emgu.LiteRT.LM.Maui.dll`: a MAUI chat control for the on-device `${EMGU_LITERT_LM_MODELS_NUGET_ID}` language models, or any `IChatClient`. It is built with XAML control templates, message templates and styles (`ChatStyles`, merged in `App.xaml`), so an app can restyle any part of it by replacing a template or a style.

The conversation logic comes from `${EMGU_LITERT_LM_CHAT_NUGET_ID}`.

This package is new: its controls are being written, and will be described here once they exist.

## Getting Started

The package has no native runtime dependency. Add the LiteRT-LM native runtime packages for your platforms, as for `${EMGU_LITERT_LM_MODELS_NUGET_ID}`.

